{"kind":"finding","id":"F-018-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ReFlyPreservedFleetGuardTests.cs","line":321,"method":"ResolveDisabledSlotVesselsToStrip_SelectedSlotIsNeverACandidate","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/RewindInvoker.cs:1802; delete the SlotIndex skip -> green because recordings[0] (pid 9, no guid, no spawn pid) matches nothing; add a conclusive guid to recordings[0] and the live pair -> red","what_it_asserts":"a Disabled slot whose SlotIndex is selectedSlotIndex is never returned by ResolveDisabledSlotVesselsToStrip, even with PidSlotMap cleared.","why_weak":"the fixture cannot reach the kill path for the selected slot: rec-selected carries neither RecordedVesselGuid nor SpawnedVesselPersistentId, so both match arms at RewindInvoker.cs:1831-1835 reject pid 9 regardless of the skip.","proposed_action":"Set recordings[0].RecordedVesselGuid to a guid and pass the same guid on the live (9u, guid) entry so the pre-guard path would name the pid, keeping Assert.Empty as the assertion.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"LoadTimeSweep","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/LoadTimeSweep.cs","sut_line":314,"case_kind":"negative","proposed_name":"SweepMissingRewindPointQuicksaves_UnresolvableQuicksavePath_SkipsRp","sketch":"Stub RewindPointReaper.ResolveQuicksaveAbsolutePathForTesting to return null for an RP whose slot tip is CommittedProvisional; call SweepMissingRewindPointQuicksaves; assert swept==0, the tip stays CommittedProvisional, the RP stays in scenario.RewindPoints, and no 'Cleaned missing rewind-point quicksave' INFO line is emitted.","guards":"Every committed sweep test returns a path or an existing temp file; File.Exists(null) is false, so dropping the empty-path skip at LoadTimeSweep.cs:314 would classify an unresolvable RP as missing, conclude its slots and let the reaper delete an RP whose quicksave was never proven absent.","risk":"recording"}
